  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of lightly salted water to boil.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add the milk, salt and 1/2 the butter and mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a0a1d4fb03440163271a/step-90a29600.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, grate carrot. Thinly slice brown onion. Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Finely chop garlic. Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a0a1d4fb03440163271a/step-6f3bc210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over high heat. Cook carrot, onion and zucchini until softened, 6-8 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Stir in garlic & herb spice blend and garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in red kidney beans, passata, the stock powder, brown sugar and remaining butter and a splash of water. Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in baby spinach and Parmesan cheese. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a0a1d4fb03440163271a/step-9d762f20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high.\n• Transfer filling mixture to a baking dish and top with mash.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.\n• Divide bean pie between plates to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a0a1d4fb03440163271a/step-5998cb30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
